# Horpynka API SDK

When the user asks to generate, update, or add an API client or operation hook, read and follow [generate-openapi-client](../skills/generate-openapi-client/SKILL.md) before editing.

- Generated code lives in `src/api/generated`. Do not edit it by hand.
- Instantiate each API class except `AppApi` in `src/client/clients.ts`, and re-export it from `src/client/index.ts`.
- Add the TanStack Query hook in `src/operations`, then export it from `src/hooks/index.ts` and `src/index.ts`.
- Compare against `OPENAPI_SPEC_URL` in `.env` (`https://horpynka.com/api/docs-json`). Leave the SDK unchanged when that spec has no new or removed operations.
